LOGBOOK.md:20:- GATES: Soft caps only new initial windows. Pressure withholds every adjustment and nonessential opens; Critical, rekeying, failed, closing, closed, stale-generation, low-water, and insufficient-reservation paths refuse without changing or queueing credit. Previously advertised credit is never represented as revoked.
